    "protected": false,
    "rendered": "<div class=\"xyz-content\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<ol class=\"m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">  <a href=\"/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Home </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <a href=\"/tax-tips/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Resources </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <span aria-current=\"page\">Working from home tax deductions</span> </li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<article class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<header class=\"max-w-3xl\">\n<p class=\"band-eyebrow\">Resources</p>\n<h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl\">Working from home tax deductions</h1>\n<p> <!-- The answer, up front. Snippet and AI Overview capture (brief §6.6). --> </p>\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-[1.125rem] text-ink\">You can claim working from home two ways: the fixed rate per hour worked at home, which bundles energy, internet, phone and stationery into one figure, or actual costs. Either way you need a record of every hour, all year.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> <span>Updated 21 August 2026</span> <span>Current for 2025-26, 2026-27</span> </p>\n</header>\n<div class=\"prose-statement mt-10\">\n<p>For most office workers this is the largest single deduction on the return, and the record-keeping rules changed in a way a lot of people still have not caught up with.</p>\n<h2 id=\"two-methods\">Two methods</h2>\n<p><strong>The fixed rate.</strong> A set amount for each hour you work from home, covering electricity and gas, home and mobile internet, phone, and stationery and computer consumables. You cannot claim any of those separately on top — that is the trade for the simplicity.</p>\n<p>You <strong>can</strong> still claim, separately, the decline in value of a desk, chair, monitor or laptop, and their repairs and maintenance.</p>\n<p><strong>Actual costs.</strong> Work out the real work-related portion of each expense: a share of electricity based on the appliances and hours, the work-use percentage of internet and phone, and depreciation on furniture and equipment. More work, usually a larger number, and it needs considerably better records.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-record-that-catches-people-out\">The record that catches people out</h2>\n<p>Since 2022-23, the fixed rate requires a record of the <strong>actual hours</strong> you worked from home across the entire income year. A four-week representative diary is no longer accepted, and neither is an estimate.</p>\n<p>A timesheet, roster, diary or spreadsheet is fine. It just has to be contemporaneous and cover the whole year. In practice, the people who lose this deduction are not the ones who did not work from home — they are the ones who did not write it down.</p>\n<p>You also need one bill for each expense the rate covers, to show you actually incurred that kind of cost.</p>\n<h2 id=\"which-method-wins\">Which method wins</h2>\n<p>The fixed rate usually wins for someone in a shared home with a modest setup and no dedicated room. Actual costs usually wins where you have a dedicated work area, a large energy bill, or expensive equipment being depreciated.</p>\n<p>The honest guidance is to work out the fixed rate figure first — it takes two minutes once you have your hours — and only go down the actual cost path if you think there is meaningfully more in it. For most people there is not.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-you-cannot-claim\">What you cannot claim</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Coffee, tea, milk and snacks. Private, even at your own desk.</li>\n<li>Rent, mortgage interest, rates and home insurance, unless you are running a genuine business from home with a dedicated place of business. Claiming occupancy costs as an employee is essentially never available, and it can cost you part of the main residence CGT exemption if you get it wrong.</li>\n<li>Anything your employer provided or reimbursed.</li>\n<li>Time you were at home but not working.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"the-interaction-with-the-1000-standard-deduction\">The interaction with the <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$1,000</span> standard deduction</h2>\n<p>From 2026-27, if your total work-related claims — home office included — come to less than <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$1,000</span>, the <a href=\"/tax-tips/standard-deduction-1000/\">standard deduction</a> gives you</p>\n<p><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$1,000</span> instead, with no records at all.</p>\n<p>For most people who work from home regularly, a full year of hours at the fixed rate already exceeds <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$1,000</span>, so the hours log is still worth keeping. Work out both and take the higher.</p>\n</p></div>\n</article>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl\">Put a number on it</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-2 max-w-2xl text-[0.9375rem]\"> Estimate your refund by adding the deductions you actually have. Watch the number move as you claim. Free, and it works without an email address. </p>\n<div class=\"mt-6\">\n<div id=\"xyz-island-0\" data-xyz-island=\"RefundCalculator\" data-xyz-props=\"{}\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_23rem] lg:gap-12\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0\">\n<div class=\"rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-4 sm:px-6\">\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_2l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">What do you do for work?</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\"><select id=\"_r1R_2l_\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)]\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Choose your occupation…</option><option value=\"nurses\">Nurses and midwives</option><option value=\"tradies\">Tradies and construction workers</option><option value=\"teachers\">Teachers and education staff</option><option value=\"sole-traders\">Sole traders and contractors</option><option value=\"doctors\">Doctors and medical practitioners</option><option value=\"students\">Students and casual workers</option><option value=\"property-investors\">Investment property owners</option></select></div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">We use this to ask about the deductions your occupation actually gets — nothing is filled in for you.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_4l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Which year are you lodging?</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\"><select id=\"_r1R_4l_\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)]\"><option value=\"2024-25\">2024–25</option><option value=\"2025-26\" selected=\"\">2025–26 (most people)</option><option value=\"2026-27\">2026–27</option></select></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_6l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Total income for the year</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$</span><input id=\"_r1R_6l_\" type=\"text\" inputMode=\"decimal\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)] pl-7 text-right\" placeholder=\"0\" value=\"75,000\"/></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">The gross figure from your income statement, before tax.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_8l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Tax withheld</label><span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">estimated</span></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$</span><input id=\"_r1R_8l_\" type=\"text\" inputMode=\"decimal\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)] pl-7 text-right\" placeholder=\"0\" value=\"15,675\"/></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Also on your income statement, usually labelled “Tax withheld”. We have estimated it until you enter the real figure.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] py-4 last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"max-w-sm\"><label for=\"_r1R_al_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">I have a HECS-HELP or study loan</label></p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">A compulsory repayment starts at <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$67,000</span> and comes out of your refund.</p>\n</div>\n<p><input id=\"_r1R_al_\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 accent-[var(--color-signal)]\"/></div>\n<div class=\"py-6\">\n<p class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Pick an occupation above and we’ll ask about the deductions that apply to it. Or<!-- --> <a href=\"/tax-tips/what-can-i-claim/\">read the full list of what you can claim</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 lg:sticky lg:top-6 lg:self-start\">\n<div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-paper)]\">Your refund</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[0.6875rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-paper)]/70\">2025–26</span></div>\n<div class=\"tally-print\">\n<div data-tally-line=\"gross\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Gross income</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$75,000</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"deductions\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Less deductions</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">−</span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$0</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"taxable\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-[var(--color-paper-sunk)]\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Taxable income</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums font-semibold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$75,000</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"income-tax\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Income tax</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$13,288</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"medicare\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Medicare levy</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$1,500</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"total-tax\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-[var(--color-paper-sunk)]\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Total tax</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums font-semibold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$14,788</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"payg\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Less tax already withheld</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">−</span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$15,675</span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"refund\" class=\"px-4 py-5\">\n<div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Estimated refund</p>\n<p class=\"m-0 mt-0.5 max-w-[22rem] text-[0.6875rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">What the ATO would pay back on these figures.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-11 shrink-0 items-center\"><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums text-[1.75rem] font-bold text-[var(--color-return)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$887</span></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"sr-only\" aria-live=\"polite\">Estimated refund<!-- -->:<!-- --> <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$887</span></p>\n<p class=\"m-0 mt-2 font-mono text-[0.6875rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$15,675 withheld − $14,788 tax</p>\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\n<div class=\"space-y-3\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp&amp;income=75000&amp;payg=15675&amp;fy=2025-26&amp;refund=887\" class=\"block rounded-[4px] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-2.5 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-paper)] no-underline\">Lodge and claim <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$887</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"m-0 text-center text-[0.6875rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Individual returns from <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$99</span>.</p>\n<p class=\"m-0 text-[0.6875rem] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">An estimate, not tax advice. We never ask for your tax file number on this site.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-testid=\"sticky-result\" class=\"fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-40 border-t border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white/95 backdrop-blur lg:hidden\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[68rem] items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0\">\n<p class=\"m-0 truncate text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Estimated refund</p>\n<p class=\"m-0 font-mono text-lg font-bold tabular-nums text-[var(--color-return)]\">$887</p>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 rounded-[4px] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-paper)] no-underline\">Claim it</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"h-20 lg:hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p><!--astro:end--></div>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"mt-6\">\n<p class=\"m-0 max-w-2xl text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"> This is an estimate, not tax advice. It works from the figures you enter and the ATO rates for the year you selected; your actual assessment is determined by the ATO and may differ. We never ask for your tax file number on this site. </p>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<div class=\"card p-6\">\n<h2 class=\"text-lg\">Keep going</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-3 max-w-2xl text-[0.9375rem]\"> Every calculator on this site is free and ungated — income tax, refunds, capital gains, HECS-HELP, Medicare and more. </p>\n<p> <a href=\"/calculators/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">All calculators</a> </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"cta-dark\">\n<div class=\"cta-grid\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"band-eyebrow\">Ready to lodge it?</p>\n<h2>A registered agent prepares it, checks it, and lodges it.</h2>\n<p>Most refunds land within two weeks of assessment. The fee is fixed and quoted before we start — nothing is charged until you approve the finished return.</p>\n<div class=\"cta-actions\"> <a href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"btn\">Start your return</a> <a href=\"/services/pricing/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">See pricing</a> </div>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec\">\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Individual returns from</span><b>$99</b></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Registered tax agent</span><b>26233684</b></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Fixed fee, quoted up front</span><i>included</i></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Fee taken from your refund</span><b>$44</b></div>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<p><script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/brseeger-cloud/xyz-accounting-assets@main/islands/RefundCalculator.js\" defer></script></p>\n"
